{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-3","kind":"proposition","title":"求三个整数的最大公约数","englishTitle":"Given three numbers not prime to one another, to find their greatest common measure.","book":7,"number":3,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.3","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.3/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":3,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","contentId":"euclid-7-3","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e736761617684f2645bcb48a85a74cef3db52ab3914dc6f6fe27a322bba1e29","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-3.statement","euclid-7-3.construction.1","euclid-7-3.construction.2","euclid-7-3.proof.1","euclid-7-3.proof.2","euclid-7-3.proof.3","euclid-7-3.proof.4","euclid-7-3.construction.3","euclid-7-3.proof.5","euclid-7-3.proof.6","euclid-7-3.proof.7","euclid-7-3.proof.8","euclid-7-3.proof.9","euclid-7-3.proof.10","euclid-7-3.proof.11","euclid-7-3.construction.4","euclid-7-3.proof.12","euclid-7-3.proof.13","euclid-7-3.proof.14","euclid-7-3.proof.15","euclid-7-3.construction.5","euclid-7-3.proof.16","euclid-7-3.proof.17","euclid-7-3.proof.18","euclid-7-3.proof.19","euclid-7-3.conclusion","euclid-7-3.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-3.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"87a6aeb57430f6b72efbeb75b2a5a4f72f477c3484725531f4b7209019847755","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Given three numbers not prime to one another, to find their greatest common measure."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三个号码不是互素 找到它们最大公约数"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d9f7b5311bad9c0afdbddf2d8374a154d56a3011f262cab8cfe1d6196aa8e9f6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B, C be the three given numbers not prime to one another; thus it is required to find the greatest common measure of A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B,C是三个给定数字,而不是互素;因此,需要找到A,B,C中最大公约数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"41036b31b527f0dd9534bfb62e685ac8dfafc6e7248be1c91252e861246e06a5","citations":["euclid-7-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the greatest common measure, D, of the two numbers A, B be taken; [[VII. 2](/principles/euclid-7-2)] then D either measures, or does not measure, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"取出两个数字中最大公约数,D,B;然后D,或整除,或整除,C。（相关点与线段：A） [[VII. 2](/principles/euclid-7-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"417172124a383d5eb40b139503383efeb7cf5d197da3c58bd3e953cd3ad77efa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let it measure it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让它整除它。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bfd4e9292a40470e9e3f63056b26f294cf5addeb9c0b72dcad3a9896744f85ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it measures A, B also; therefore D measures A, B, C; therefore D is a common measure of A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也为整除 A B;因此,D 整除 A B,B;因此,D是A B中的整除,C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"25fda64abe0b7c194eef43e6d7b2a2d52c85255ea16b2e8fb4b39928117407be","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that it is also the greatest."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,这也是最伟大的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"80cbb991e3767d85dc186dddd7b8211d8bec5c8891cd2f42b1b8190024822ac9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if D is not the greatest common measure of A, B, C, some number which is greater than D will measure the numbers A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果D不是A、B、C中最大公约数,那么,如果超过D,则A、B、C将达到整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":7,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dbda84f3790eddc715ae8ed3f99ca30be650f51b233e209c2de323a51b8687c6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let such a number measure them, and let it be E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们整除,E"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f561b0917bc982a9e284c2cfc0f2e677b9ffe7066a08c939ab7fe9bbc089eb6","citations":["euclid-7-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then E measures A, B, C, it will also measure A, B; therefore it will also measure the greatest common measure of A, B. [[VII. 2, Por.](/principles/euclid-7-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那以后,E 整除 A,B,C, 还将有整除 A,B;因此,A,B中,整除将是最大公约数。 [[VII. 2, Por.](/principles/euclid-7-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e7abb98cc95629eac39e5b192931a19ffb7f92c836193cd7856642b701d6cefd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the greatest common measure of A, B is D; therefore E measures D, the greater the less: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A,B中最大公约数,D;因此,E,整除,D,数量越大,数量就越小:这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0247621c328ec5a3d39bfc86d986aaabe082ffb8ffc24e567831d6ffaf8807d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore no number which is greater than D will measure the numbers A, B, C; therefore D is the greatest common measure of A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果数字不超过D,整除将达到A,B,C;因此,D是A,B,C中最常见的整除；其中所求的量是最大公约数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"46460456373ef9a7c52460d3e65df3cb91c3180cf691a2febab3691f42cb7772","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let D not measure C; I say first that C, D are not prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,让D而不是整除 C;我首先说,C,D不是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1a96622ed369b5e5b652162ccc9f882eecee4763d93f03aba29dd1b7c081165","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A, B, C are not prime to one another, some number will measure them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A,B,C不是互素, 一些人会整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c4737b48d535aa2be5988109e8cbdfc3329c59fd5986d5bab0e4bff5143288fa","citations":["euclid-7-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now that which measures A, B, C will also measure A, B, and will measure D, the greatest common measure of A, B. [[VII. 2, Por.](/principles/euclid-7-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,整除 A,B,C 也整除 A,B, 和整除 D, 最大共同的整除,B；其中所求的量是最大公约数。 [[VII. 2, Por.](/principles/euclid-7-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf57e12183ce2a724c36dac0f12e6ac4d0601db9d7b15439f1f528a8934996b0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it measures C also; therefore some number will measure the numbers D, C; therefore D, C are not prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也为整除 C;因此,有些数字将达到整除,D,C;因此,D,C不是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":15,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c527c719bc39e32a1761c71db17210f0847e3ab3aeebecc58f08998dd675ad2","citations":["euclid-7-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then their greatest common measure E be taken. [[VII. 2](/principles/euclid-7-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们的整除、E大公车；其中所求的量是最大公约数。 [[VII. 2](/principles/euclid-7-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"50aab7ec4d54b11d04d0bb6ae79d4ea732f99675f674e2e47180789b8479f80c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since E measures D, and D measures A, B, therefore E also measures A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,从E 整除 D和D 整除 A,B,E,整除,A,E,E,E,A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c35cb459525c1acafffa86f9d705fecdcf372d8100d38c932f31e2e8b7061102","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it measures C also; therefore E measures A, B, C; therefore E is a common measure of A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也为整除 C;因此,E 整除 A,B,C;因此,E是A,B,C的共同整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d601a2226cb30a3cfb5f77868366f58ff9f45ffd66f31803b59b1f868041374","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that it is also the greatest."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来说,这也是最伟大的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"881dc7d1839882773c3309052b9763c1fcf7ecd7b1b5a920ef85708b02b8ed9e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if E is not the greatest common measure of A, B, C, some number which is greater than E will measure the numbers A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果E不是A、B、C中最大公约数,那么,如果超过E,则A、B、C将达到整除。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.construction.5","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":20,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"968b1cc3cbacafe6f1e5df24acdfe910e907741f6dcbd17d18d78bf308a2b6ea","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let such a number measure them, and let it be F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它们整除,F"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"74ab67cb55533d87cac9288ce7a7e7c99aa5a156c894d5ce193887095279613b","citations":["euclid-7-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since F measures A, B, C, it also measures A, B; therefore it will also measure the greatest common measure of A, B. [[VII. 2, Por.](/principles/euclid-7-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,自F 整除 A,B,C, F,F,A,B,因此,它也将是A,B中最常用的整除；其中所求的量是最大公约数。 [[VII. 2, Por.](/principles/euclid-7-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07cb3d899ba685ee3a3937b89cfac567c959b8e9b0bd06969429096278940254","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the greatest common measure of A, B is D; therefore F measures D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A中最大公约数,B为D,因此F 整除 D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e953a87254895011ec18faab5f991528a35d44a28eca9cc7495c0e97443fd43","citations":["euclid-7-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it measures C also; therefore F measures D, C; therefore it will also measure the greatest common measure of D, C. [[VII. 2, Por.](/principles/euclid-7-2)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"并且 F 也整除 C，因此 F 同时整除 D 与 C，所以 F 也整除 D 与 C 的最大公约数。 [[VII. 2, Por.](/principles/euclid-7-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ce1c8be4bb51e35ed9a77d3327c3733f80a7f0fdaee40f4b305a0a2d404530e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the greatest common measure of D, C is E; therefore F measures E, the greater the less: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但D,C中最大公约数,E;因此,F,整除,E,数量越大,数量就越小:这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":25,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3563851ee2149c2546dca873535847706ca1eeca32345e2983574336d4bfb2ec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore no number which is greater than E will measure the numbers A, B, C; therefore E is the greatest common measure of A, B, C. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,如果数字不超过E,则这一数字为A,B,C;因此,E是A,B,C中最大公约数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-3.source","contentId":"euclid-7-3","revisionId":"euclid-7-3@raw-2e736761617684f2","order":26,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"83c8dba8115c06c10c6403fda585a